WEBVTT

00:00:57.716 --> 00:01:00.876
Yet, the power they wield is immense.

00:01:01.556 --> 00:01:04.276
Ultimately, we trust the system

00:01:04.316 --> 00:01:08.996
because we believe
that judges generally get it right.

00:01:09.396 --> 00:01:10.996
If we lose that belief,

00:01:11.036 --> 00:01:14.196
we risk unbalancing
the whole constitution.

00:01:15.236 --> 00:01:20.596
But we live in a time when blind faith
in elites is eroding fast.

00:01:21.276 --> 00:01:25.316
Judges are increasingly vulnerable
to the "why" question.

00:01:25.836 --> 00:01:30.036
Why do you deserve the power
we have given you?